       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    CARIBITM.
       AUTHOR.        BILL FONAGY.
      ************************************************************
      **                                                        **
      **  C A R I B I T M                                       **
      **                                                        **
      **  THIS SUBROUTINE EDITS THE INDIVIDUAL LINE ITEMS ON A  **
      **  PURCHASE ORDER SENT TO IT BY ARIBA BUYER.  IT IS      **
      **  CALLED FROM 'TARIBAPO' AND WILL RECEIVE AN ARRAY      **
      **  CONTAINING THE INDIVIDUAL LINE ITEMS.  IT WILL THEN   **
      **  VALIDATE THE FIELDS FOR EACH LINE AND PASS BACK       **
      **  TO 'TARIBAPO' A SUCCESS OR FAILURE FLAG.              **
      **                                                        **
      *****************************************************************
      **           M O D I F I C A T I O N    H I S T O R Y
      *****************************************************************
      ** WHO       WHEN      DESCRIPTION OF CHANGE
      ** --------  --------  ------------------------------------------
DCR01 ** D.RAUCH   11/01/02  CONVERTED FROM HP3000 TO AS400
DCR01 ** DCR01               INACTIVATED EEC PROCESSING PER BILL FONAGY
      ** --------  --------  ------------------------------------------
DCR02 ** D.RAUCH    7/14/03  ADD LOGIC TO ALLOW CHANGE\CANCEL PROCESS'G
DCR02 ** DCR02      SEE TARIBAPO FOR EDITS TO HEADER RECORD FIELDS
      ** --------  --------  ------------------------------------------
      ** D.RAUCH    1/09/04  RECOMPILED TO INCORPORATE CHANGE TO COPY
      **            MEMBER ARIBAPOITM - ADDED REQ# TO TRAILING FILLER.
      **            --- NO CODE CHANGE REQUIRED !
      ** --------  --------  ------------------------------------------
DCR03 ** D.RAUCH    5/03/04  ADDED CHECK TO STOREROOM ITEM LOGIC FOR
DCR03 **            ZERO OR BLANK EXPENSE CLASS - PER DAVE PLUM.
      ** --------  --------  ------------------------------------------
DCR04 ** D.RAUCH    5/12/04  ADDED CHECK TO STOREROOM ITEM LOGIC TO CHG
DCR04 **            EXPENSE CLASS TO ZERO FOR NAPANEE(631) STOREROOM
DCR04 **            CODED ITEMS.
      *****************************************************************

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.

       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.    LOCAL-DATA IS LDA.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.

           SELECT MVALPLTDTA-FILE   ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1701
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  FILE STATUS WS-FILE-STATUS
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY.

           SELECT MSTOREROOM-FILE   ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  FILE STATUS WS-FILE-STATUS
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY.

           SELECT MVALIDUM-FILE     ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0401
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  FILE STATUS WS-FILE-STATUS
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY.

           SELECT MCOMMENT-FILE     ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1801
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  FILE STATUS WS-FILE-STATUS
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY.

           SELECT MTAX-FILE         ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS3701
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  FILE STATUS WS-FILE-STATUS
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY.

           SELECT EEC-COMMCD-FILE   ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS5301
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  FILE STATUS WS-FILE-STATUS
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  WITH DUPLICATES.

           SELECT VALID-DATA-FILE   ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS5202
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  FILE STATUS WS-FILE-STATUS
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  WITH DUPLICATES.

DCR02      SELECT DPOITEM-FILE      ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1002
DCR02             ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
DCR02             ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
DCR02             FILE STATUS WS-FILE-STATUS
DCR02             RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.

       FD  MVALPLTDTA-FILE.
       01  MVALPLTDTA-REC.
       COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS1701.
       COPY MVALDPLT IN COPYLIB.

       FD  MSTOREROOM-FILE.
       01  MSTOREROOM-REC.
       COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS0201.
       COPY MSTORERM IN COPYLIB.

       FD  MVALIDUM-FILE.
       01  MVALIDUM-REC.
       COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS0401.
       COPY MVALIDUM IN COPYLIB.

       FD  MCOMMENT-FILE.
       01  MCOMMENT-REC.
       COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS1801.
       COPY MCOMMENT IN COPYLIB.

       FD  MTAX-FILE.
       01  MTAX-REC.
       COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS3701.
       COPY MTAX     IN COPYLIB.

       FD  EEC-COMMCD-FILE.
       01  EEC-COMMCD-REC.
       COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS5301.
       COPY MEECCMCD IN COPYLIB.

       FD  VALID-DATA-FILE.
       01  VALID-DATA-REC.
       COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS5202.
       COPY DVLDDATA IN COPYLIB.

DCR02  FD  DPOITEM-FILE.
DCR02  01  DPOITEM-REC.
DCR02  COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS1002.
DCR02  COPY DPOITEM  IN COPYLIB.

      *----------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------

       COPY FILESTATUS IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CVALID IN COPYLIB.

      **********************
      *                    *
      *  S W I T C H E S   *
      *                    *
      **********************

       01  SWITCH-AREA.
           05  EEC-COMMCODE-SW       PIC X       VALUE SPACES.
           05  EEC-MBR-SW            PIC X       VALUE SPACES.
           05  SAVE-PACD-SW          PIC X       VALUE SPACES.
           05  SAVE-PCPO-SW          PIC X       VALUE SPACES.
           05  SAVE-CHAT-SW          PIC X       VALUE SPACES.
DCR03      05  WS-FUNKY-EXP-CLS-SW   PIC X(6)    VALUE SPACES.
DCR03          88  ZERO-OR-BLANK-EXP-CLS   VALUES "000000"  "      ".

       01  SAVE-AREA.
           05  BU-DISPLAY-MSG        PIC X(60)   VALUE SPACES.
           05  SAVE-EEC-COMMCODE     PIC X(12)   VALUE SPACES.
           05  SAVE-PLANT            PIC X(3)    VALUE SPACES.
           05  SAVE-PRIME            PIC X(3)    VALUE SPACES.
           05  SAVE-STR-DEPT         PIC X(4)    VALUE SPACES.

       01  SUB-AREA.
           05  SUB                   PIC 9(3)    VALUE ZEROS.
           05  SUB1                  PIC 9(3)    VALUE ZEROS.

       01  WORK-AREA.
           05  SEQ-NO-SAVE.
               10  SEQ-ITEM-NO-SAVE        PIC 9(4)  VALUE ZEROS.
               10  LINE-NO-SAVE            PIC 99    VALUE ZEROS.

       01  WORK-AREA-KEYS.

DCR02      05  WS-PLNT-KEY          PIC X(04)       VALUE "P 01".
DCR02      05  WS-PACD-KEY          PIC X(04)       VALUE "PACD".
DCR02      05  WS-PCPO-KEY          PIC X(04)       VALUE "PCPO".
DCR02      05  WS-CHAT-KEY          PIC X(04)       VALUE "CHAT".
DCR02      05  WS-DSTR-KEY          PIC X(04)       VALUE "DSTR".
DCR02      05  WS-EECM-KEY          PIC X(04)       VALUE "EECM".

           05  BUILD-VALID-DEPT-KEY.
               10  DEPT-PREFIX            PIC XX   VALUE "DP".
               10  DEPT-NUM               PIC X(8) VALUE SPACES.

           05  BUILD-EXPENSE-CLASS.
               10  FILLER                 PIC X(2) VALUE "EC".
               10  EXPENSE-CLASS          PIC X(6) VALUE SPACES.

           05  BUILD-NEW-WORK.
               10  FILLER                 PIC X(2) VALUE "NW".
               10  NEW-WORK               PIC X(6) VALUE SPACES.

           05  BUILD-COMMENT-NO.
               10  BUILD-COM-PREFIX       PIC X     VALUE "C".
               10  BUILD-COM-NO           PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.

DCR02      05  BUILD-PO-SEARCH.
DCR02          10  PO-PREFIX              PIC X       VALUE SPACE.
DCR02          10  PO-NO-REL.
DCR02              15  PO-NO              PIC X(7)    VALUE SPACE.
DCR02              15  PO-REL             PIC X(3)    VALUE SPACE.
DCR02          10  PO-RCV                 PIC X(3)    VALUE SPACE.


       COPY ARIBAPOITM  IN COPYLIB.
       COPY MPLTINFO    IN COPYLIB.
       COPY ZMPLTWS     IN COPYLIB.

      *********************
      *                   *
      *   DATA SET NAMES  *
      *                   *
      *********************
       01  DSET-NAMES.
           05  DSET-NAME              PIC X(16) VALUE SPACES.
           05  DSET-MSTORERM          PIC X(16) VALUE "MSTORERM;".
           05  DSET-MCOMMENT          PIC X(16) VALUE "MCOMMENT;".
           05  DSET-MVALIDUM          PIC X(16) VALUE "MVALIDUM;".
           05  DSET-MTAX              PIC X(16) VALUE "MTAX;".
           05  DSET-MVALIDPLTDATA     PIC X(16) VALUE "MVALIDPLTDATA;".
           05  DSET-MPLTINFO          PIC X(16) VALUE "MPLTINFO;".
           05  DSET-MEECCMCD          PIC X(16) VALUE "MEECCMCD;".

       01  ITEMS-LISTING.
           05  ALL-ITEMS              PIC XX    VALUE "@;".

       01 ARG-VALUES.
           05  CODE-ARG               PIC X(8)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  MVALIDPLT-ARG.
               10  MVALIDPLT-ARG-1-2  PIC XX    VALUE SPACES.
               10  MVALIDPLT-ARG-3-10.
                   15  MVALIDPLT-ARG-3-8  PIC 9(6).
                   15  FILLER             PIC XX.
           05  COMMENT-ARG            PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  UM-ARG                 PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  TAX-ARG                PIC X(2)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  PLT-ARG                PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  COMMCODE-ARG           PIC X(12) VALUE SPACES.
DCR02      05  PO2-ARG                PIC X(14) VALUE SPACES.

       01  WS-MISCELLANEOUS-FLDS.
           03  WS-HOLDNUM-FLD        PIC 9(14)    VALUE ZERO.
           03  WS-HOLDNUM-FLD-A   REDEFINES WS-HOLDNUM-FLD  PIC X(14).

DCR04      03  WS-ZERO-EXP-CLS       PIC X(6)    VALUE "000000".

DCR02      03  WS-ITEM-ERR-MSG.
DCR02          05  FILLER           PIC X(10)       VALUE "ITEM NBR:".
DCR02          05  WS-ITEM-ERR-NBR  PIC X(04)       VALUE SPACE.

       01 WS-PROGRAM-MESSAGES.
           03  WS-DEPT-MSG1          PIC X(60)          VALUE
               "ERR - INVALID DEPARTMENT CODE".
           03  WS-EXPCLS-MSG1        PIC X(60)          VALUE
               "ERR - INVALID EXPENSE CLASS".
           03  WS-EXPCLS-MSG2        PIC X(60)          VALUE
               "ERR - INVALID EXPENSE CLASS -OR- WORK NUMBER".
           03  WS-UOM-MSG1           PIC X(60)          VALUE
               "ERR - INVALID UNIT OF MEASURE".
           03  WS-UOM-MSG2           PIC X(60)          VALUE
               "ERR - INVALID UNIT OF MEASURE FOR INVOICELESS".
           03  WS-UOM-MSG3           PIC X(60)          VALUE
               "ERR - INVALID UNIT PRICE UNIT OF MEASURE".
           03  WS-UOM-MSG4           PIC X(60)          VALUE
               "ERR - QUANTITY UOM NOT A STOREROOM UOM".
           03  WS-UOM-MSG5           PIC X(60)          VALUE
               "ERR - PRICE UOM NOT A STOREROOM UOM".
           03  WS-UOM-MSG6           PIC X(60)          VALUE
               "ERR - QUANTITY/PRICE UOM MUST BE = FOR NON-CODED PO".
           03  WS-QTY-MSG1           PIC X(60)          VALUE
               "ERR - QUANTITY MUST BE > ZERO".
           03  WS-PRICE-MSG1         PIC X(60)          VALUE
               "ERR - PRICE MUST BE > ZERO".
           03  WS-COMMCD-MSG1        PIC X(60)          VALUE
               "ERR - COMMODITY CODE MUST BE ENTERED".
           03  WS-COMMCD-MSG2        PIC X(60)          VALUE
               "ERR - INVALID COMMODITY CODE".
           03  WS-COMMCD-MSG3        PIC X(60)          VALUE
              "ERR - COMMODITY CODE CANT BE CHGD - ORIGINAL REDISPLAY".
           03  WS-EECCOO-MSG1        PIC X(60)          VALUE
              "ERR - INVALID COUNTRY OF ORIGIN".
           03  WS-TAXCD-MSG1         PIC X(60)          VALUE
              "ERR - INVALID TAX CODE".
           03  WS-COMPANY-MSG1      PIC X(60)          VALUE
              "ERR - COMPANY IS A REQUIRED ENTRY".
           03  WS-COMPANY-MSG2      PIC X(60)          VALUE
              "ERR - INVALID COMPANY CODE".
           03  WS-PRIME-MSG1        PIC X(60)          VALUE
              "ERR - PRIME IS A REQUIRED ENTRY".
           03  WS-PRIME-MSG2        PIC X(60)          VALUE
              "ERR - INVALID PRIME CODE".
           03  WS-CLASS-MSG1        PIC X(60)          VALUE
              "ERR - CLASS IS A REQUIRED ENTRY".
           03  WS-CLASS-MSG2        PIC X(60)          VALUE
              "ERR - INVALID CLASS ENTERED".
           03  WS-EXPNW-MSG1        PIC X(60)          VALUE
              "ERR - INVALID EXP/NW FOR CLASS".
           03  WS-COMMENT-MSG1      PIC X(60)          VALUE
              "ERR - INVALID INSTRUCTION NUMBER".
           03  WS-STORERM-MSG1      PIC X(60)          VALUE
              "ERR - MUST BE CODED ITEM FOR STOREROOM DEPARTMENT".
           03  WS-NR-MSG1           PIC X(60)          VALUE
              "ERR - NON-RECEIVABLE MUST BE NON-CODED - 'NC' IN CODE".

DCR02      03  WS-CC-PO-NBR-MISSING-MSG PIC X(60)          VALUE
DCR02      "CHG\CNL ERR- ARIBA ITEM - CSIS PO NUMBER MISSING".
DCR02      03  WS-CC-LINE-ITEM-NFND-MSG PIC X(60)          VALUE
DCR02      "CHG\CNL ERR - CSIS ITEM RECORD(DPOITEM) NFND".
DCR02      03  WS-CC-ITM-QTY-ERR-MSG1   PIC X(80)     VALUE
DCR02      "CHG\CNL ERR - CSIS ITEM CHG FAILED - QTY < DELIVERED ".
DCR02      03  WS-CC-ITM-UOM-ERR-MSG1   PIC X(80)     VALUE
DCR02      "CHG\CNL ERR - CSIS ITEM UOM CANT BE CHGD AFTER RECEIPT".
DCR02      03  WS-CC-ITM-UOM-ERR-MSG2   PIC X(80)     VALUE
DCR02      "CHG\CNL ERR - CSIS PRICE UOM CANT BE CHGD AFTER RECEIPT".
DCR02      03  WS-CC-ITM-PRC-ERR-MSG1   PIC X(80)     VALUE
DCR02      "CHG\CNL ERR - CSIS UNIT PRICE CANT BE CHGD AFTER RECEIPT".
DCR02      03  WS-CC-ITM-DPT-ERR-MSG1   PIC X(80)     VALUE
DCR02      "CHG\CNL ERR - ACCTG DATA(DEPT) CANT BE CHGD AFTER RECEIPT".

      *================================================================
      *===             L I N K A G E   S E C T I O N
      *================================================================
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  BASE                         PIC X(10).

       01  ARIBAITEM-AREA-TBL.
           03  ARIBAITEM-AREA           OCCURS 300 TIMES
                                        PIC X(260).
       01  ARIBAITEM-FIELDS.
           03  NON-RECV-SW              PIC X.
           03  ITEM-CNT                 PIC 9(3).
           03  ITEM-REQ-NO              PIC X(12).
           03  INVOICELESS-IND          PIC X.
           03  ITEM-VALID-SW            PIC X.
           03  ADD-EDIT-ADDTL-DATA-SW   PIC X.

       COPY LANGSUB IN COPYLIB.

       01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           03  MSG-TXT               PIC X(66).
           03  MSG-FLD               PIC X(14).

      *================================================================
      *===           P R O C E D U R E    D I V I S I O N
      *================================================================
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BASE
                                ARIBAITEM-AREA-TBL
                                ARIBAITEM-FIELDS
                                LANGUAGE-PARMS
                                MESSAGE-BUFFER.

       0000-PROGRAM-ENTRY.

           OPEN  INPUT  MSTOREROOM-FILE
                        MVALIDUM-FILE
                        MVALPLTDTA-FILE
                        MCOMMENT-FILE
                        EEC-COMMCD-FILE
                        VALID-DATA-FILE
DCR02                   DPOITEM-FILE
                        MTAX-FILE.


           INITIALIZE MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           PERFORM 1-HSK THRU 1-H-X.

           PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-M-X.

           CLOSE        MSTOREROOM-FILE
                        MVALIDUM-FILE
                        MVALPLTDTA-FILE
                        MCOMMENT-FILE
                        EEC-COMMCD-FILE
                        VALID-DATA-FILE
DCR02                   DPOITEM-FILE
                        MTAX-FILE.

       0000-PROGRAM-EXIT.
           GOBACK.

       1-HSK.

      * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
      *    RETRIEVE SWITCHES USED FOR LUX ACCOUNT CODE LOGICS
      * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *

            MOVE "Y" TO ITEM-VALID-SW.

      *
      *    RETRIEVE MPLTINFO USING KEY "PACD"
      *
DCR02      MOVE WS-PACD-KEY      TO WS-ZMPLT-KEY.
DCR02      PERFORM ZMPLT-GET-MPLTINFO  THRU ZMPLT-EXIT.
DCR02      MOVE WS-ZMPLT-PLTINFODTA TO MPLTINFO-DATA.
DCR02      MOVE WS-ZMPLT-FILE-STATUS  TO  WS-FILE-STATUS.
           IF FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
               MOVE "N"                TO SAVE-PACD-SW
               MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
               MOVE "ERR PACD READK-MPLTINFO  " TO MSG-TXT
               MOVE WS-ZMPLT-KEY                TO MSG-FLD
           ELSE
               MOVE MPLTINFO-PACD-SW   TO SAVE-PACD-SW
           END-IF.


      *
      *    RETRIEVE MPLTINFO USING KEY "PCPO"
      *
DCR02      MOVE WS-PCPO-KEY      TO WS-ZMPLT-KEY.
DCR02      PERFORM ZMPLT-GET-MPLTINFO  THRU ZMPLT-EXIT.
DCR02      MOVE WS-ZMPLT-PLTINFODTA TO MPLTINFO-DATA.
DCR02      MOVE WS-ZMPLT-FILE-STATUS  TO  WS-FILE-STATUS.
           IF FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
               MOVE "N"                TO SAVE-PCPO-SW
               MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
               MOVE "ERR PCPO READK-MPLTINFO  " TO MSG-TXT
               MOVE WS-ZMPLT-KEY                TO MSG-FLD
           ELSE
               MOVE MPLTINFO-PCPO-SW   TO SAVE-PCPO-SW
           END-IF.

      *
      *    RETRIEVE MPLTINFO USING KEY "CHAT"
      *
DCR02      MOVE WS-CHAT-KEY      TO WS-ZMPLT-KEY.
DCR02      PERFORM ZMPLT-GET-MPLTINFO  THRU ZMPLT-EXIT.
DCR02      MOVE WS-ZMPLT-PLTINFODTA TO MPLTINFO-DATA.
DCR02      MOVE WS-ZMPLT-FILE-STATUS  TO  WS-FILE-STATUS.
           IF FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
               MOVE "N"                TO SAVE-CHAT-SW
               MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
               MOVE "ERR CHAT READK-MPLTINFO  " TO MSG-TXT
               MOVE WS-ZMPLT-KEY                TO MSG-FLD
           ELSE
               MOVE MPLTINFO-CHAT-PURCH-REQUIRED TO
                                  SAVE-CHAT-SW
           END-IF.

      *
      *    GET PLANT NUMBER, PRIME
      *
DCR02      MOVE WS-PLNT-KEY      TO WS-ZMPLT-KEY.
DCR02      PERFORM ZMPLT-GET-MPLTINFO  THRU ZMPLT-EXIT.
DCR02      MOVE WS-ZMPLT-PLTINFODTA TO MPLTINFO-DATA.
DCR02      MOVE WS-ZMPLT-FILE-STATUS  TO  WS-FILE-STATUS.
           IF FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
               MOVE SPACES             TO SAVE-PLANT,
                                          SAVE-PRIME
           ELSE
               MOVE MPLTINFO-COMPANY   TO SAVE-PLANT
               MOVE MPLTINFO-PRIME     TO SAVE-PRIME
           END-IF.

      *
      *    GET STOREROOM DEPARTMENT
      *
DCR02      MOVE WS-DSTR-KEY      TO WS-ZMPLT-KEY.
DCR02      PERFORM ZMPLT-GET-MPLTINFO  THRU ZMPLT-EXIT.
DCR02      MOVE WS-ZMPLT-PLTINFODTA TO MPLTINFO-DATA.
DCR02      MOVE WS-ZMPLT-FILE-STATUS  TO  WS-FILE-STATUS.
           IF FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
               MOVE SPACES                TO SAVE-STR-DEPT
           ELSE
               MOVE MPLTINFO-DEPT-STR (1) TO SAVE-STR-DEPT
           END-IF.

      *
      *    RETRIEVE EEC SWITCHES
      *
           MOVE "N" TO EEC-COMMCODE-SW, EEC-MBR-SW.
DCR01 **************************************************************
DCR01 ** EEC PROCESSING INACTIVE ON AS400 PER BILL FONAGY 11/01/2002
DCR01 **************************************************************
DCR01 *    MOVE WS-EECM-KEY      TO WS-ZMPLT-KEY.
DCR01 *    PERFORM ZMPLT-GET-MPLTINFO  THRU ZMPLT-EXIT.
DCR01 *    MOVE WS-ZMPLT-PLTINFODTA TO MPLTINFO-DATA.
DCR01 *    MOVE WS-ZMPLT-FILE-STATUS  TO  WS-FILE-STATUS.
DCR01 *    IF FS-GOOD-FILE-IO
DCR01 *        MOVE MPLTINFO-EEC-MEMBR TO EEC-MBR-SW
DCR01 *        MOVE MPLTINFO-EEC-PO    TO EEC-COMMCODE-SW
DCR01 *    END-IF.
DCR01 **************************************************************

       1-H-X.
           EXIT.

       6-MAIN.

           PERFORM 62-PROCESS-ITEM-DATA THRU 62-PID-X
               VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL
                       SUB > ITEM-CNT OR
                       ITEM-VALID-SW = "N".

       6-M-X.
           EXIT.

      *****************************************************
      *                                                   *
      *   PROCESS PO ITEM INFORMATION SECTION             *
      *                                                   *
      *****************************************************
       62-PROCESS-ITEM-DATA.

           INITIALIZE BUF-ARIBAPO-DETAIL,
                      ARG-VALUES,
                      MESSAGE-BUFFER.

           MOVE ARIBAITEM-AREA (SUB) TO BUF-ARIBAPO-DETAIL.

DCR02 **==CHG\CNL======================================================
DCR02 **  THE ENTIRE PO GETS SENT DOWN DURING CHANGE\CANCEL PROCESS
DCR02 **  PROCESS ONLY THOSE RECORDS THAT HAVE CHANGED:
DCR02 **  --> RECORDS WHERE 2ND POSITION OF ARIBAITM-REC-IND = "C"
DCR02 **===============================================================
DCR02      IF  ARIBAITM-REC-IND  OF BUF-ARIBAPO-DETAIL(1:1) = "4"
DCR02      AND ARIBAITM-REC-IND  OF BUF-ARIBAPO-DETAIL(2:1) NOT = "C"
DCR02          GO TO 62-PID-X
DCR02      END-IF.

DCR02      IF  ARIBAITM-REC-IND  OF BUF-ARIBAPO-DETAIL(1:1) = "4"
DCR02          PERFORM 625-CHG-CNL-EDITS  THRU  625-CC-EXIT
DCR02          IF  ITEM-VALID-SW = "N"
DCR02              GO TO 62-PID-X
DCR02          END-IF
DCR02      END-IF.

           PERFORM 620-PCPO-EDITS   THRU 620-PE-X.
           IF ITEM-VALID-SW = "N"
               GO TO 62-PID-X
           END-IF.

      ********************************************************
      *
      *  EDIT CORPORATE CODE.  MAKE SURE IT EXISTS AND HAS
      *  VALID UNIT OF MEASURE.
      *
      ********************************************************
           IF ARIBAITM-CORP-CODE = "NON-STR"
               PERFORM 621-EDIT-NONCODED-ITEM  THRU  621-ENI-X
           ELSE
               PERFORM 621-EDIT-CODED-ITEM  THRU  621-ECI-X
           END-IF.

           IF ITEM-VALID-SW = "N"
               GO TO 62-PID-X
           END-IF.

       62-EDIT-DEPT.

           MOVE ARIBAITM-SUB-DETL     TO  DEPT-NUM.
           MOVE BUILD-VALID-DEPT-KEY  TO MVALIDPLT-ARG.
           PERFORM 9010-READK-MVALPLTDTA    THRU 9010-READK-EXIT.
           IF FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
      *       "DEPARTMENT CODE DOES NOT EXIST"
               MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
               MOVE WS-DEPT-MSG1          TO MSG-TXT
               MOVE MVALIDPLT-ARG TO MSG-FLD
               GO TO 62-PID-X
           END-IF.

      ***********************************
      *
      *  EDIT ADDITIONAL DATA FOR
      *  EITHER A VALID EXPENSE CLASS OR
      *  NEW WORK NUMBER
      *
      ***********************************

       62-EDIT-ADDTL-DATA.

           IF ARIBAITM-ADDTL-DATA = SPACES OR
              ADD-EDIT-ADDTL-DATA-SW = "N"
              GO TO 62-EDIT-UMS
           END-IF.

           IF SAVE-PCPO-SW = "Y"
      *        "EXP CLASS NOT 000-099, SKIP VALID. OF ADDTL DATA"
               IF ARIBAITM-SUB < "000" OR ARIBAITM-SUB > "099"
                   GO TO 62-EDIT-UMS
               END-IF
           END-IF.

           MOVE ARIBAITM-EXP-NW       TO  EXPENSE-CLASS.
           MOVE BUILD-EXPENSE-CLASS   TO  MVALIDPLT-ARG.
           PERFORM 9010-READK-MVALPLTDTA    THRU 9010-READK-EXIT.
           IF FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
               MOVE ARIBAITM-EXP-NW       TO  NEW-WORK
               MOVE BUILD-NEW-WORK        TO  MVALIDPLT-ARG
               PERFORM 9010-READK-MVALPLTDTA    THRU 9010-READK-EXIT
               IF FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
      *      "INVALID EXPENSE CLASS OR NEW WORK NUMBER"
                  MOVE WS-EXPCLS-MSG2         TO MSG-TXT
                  MOVE MVALIDPLT-ARG TO MSG-FLD
                  MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
                  GO TO 62-PID-X
               END-IF
           END-IF.

       62-EDIT-UMS.

           IF  ARIBAITM-UNIT-MEASURE NOT = SPACES
           OR  ARIBAITM-QTY-ORDERED  NOT = ZEROS
               MOVE ARIBAITM-UNIT-MEASURE TO UM-ARG
               PERFORM 9030-READK-MVALIDUM   THRU 9030-READK-EXIT
               IF FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
                   MOVE WS-UOM-MSG1     TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
                   MOVE ARIBAITM-UNIT-MEASURE       TO MSG-FLD
      ************ MOVE "INVALID QUANTITY UM      " TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
                   MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
                   GO TO 62-PID-X
               END-IF
           END-IF.

           IF INVOICELESS-IND = "Y"
               IF ARIBAITM-UNIT-MEASURE = "AS" OR "LT"
                  MOVE WS-UOM-MSG2     TO MSG-TXT
                  MOVE ARIBAITM-UNIT-MEASURE       TO MSG-FLD
      *********** MOVE "INVALID UM FOR INVOICELESS" TO MSG-BUFFER
                  MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
                  GO TO 62-PID-X
               ELSE
DCR02          IF  ARIBAITM-REC-IND  OF BUF-ARIBAPO-DETAIL(1:1) = "2"
DCR02          AND ARIBAITM-QTY-ORDERED = ZEROES
      *************  MOVE "QTY MUST BE > ZERO    " TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
                     MOVE ARIBAITM-QTY-ORDERED  TO WS-HOLDNUM-FLD
                     MOVE WS-HOLDNUM-FLD-A      TO MSG-FLD
                     MOVE WS-QTY-MSG1     TO MSG-TXT
                     MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
                     GO TO 62-PID-X
                  END-IF
               END-IF
           END-IF.

      **************************************************
      ** THE PRICE UM IS CHECKED AGAINST THE DATABASE **
      **************************************************

           IF ARIBAITM-PRICE-UM NOT = SPACES OR
              ARIBAITM-UNIT-PRICE NOT = ZEROS
               MOVE ARIBAITM-PRICE-UM TO UM-ARG
               PERFORM 9030-READK-MVALIDUM   THRU 9030-READK-EXIT
               IF FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
      *            "UNIT PRICE UM IS INVALID"
      ************ MOVE "UNIT PRICE UM IS INVALID " TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
                   MOVE WS-UOM-MSG3     TO MSG-TXT
                   MOVE ARIBAITM-PRICE-UM  TO MSG-FLD
                   MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
                   GO TO 62-PID-X
               END-IF
           END-IF.

           IF INVOICELESS-IND = "Y"
               IF ARIBAITM-PRICE-UM = "AS" OR "LT"
      *            "UNIT OF MEASURE INVALID FOR INVOICELESS"
                  MOVE WS-UOM-MSG2     TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
      *********** MOVE "UM INVALID FOR INVOICELESS" TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
                  MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
                  GO TO 62-PID-X
               ELSE
                   IF ARIBAITM-UNIT-PRICE = ZEROES
      **************** MOVE "PRICE MUST BE > ZERO  " TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
                       MOVE WS-PRICE-MSG1   TO MSG-TXT
                       MOVE ARIBAITM-UNIT-PRICE  TO WS-HOLDNUM-FLD
                       MOVE WS-HOLDNUM-FLD-A     TO MSG-FLD
                       MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
                       GO TO 62-PID-X
                   END-IF
               END-IF
           END-IF.


       62-EDIT-EEC-FIELDS.

DCR01 **************************************************************
DCR01 ** EEC PROCESSING INACTIVE ON AS400 PER BILL FONAGY 11/01/2002
DCR01 ** SKIP DIRECTLY TO TAX CODE PROCESSING
DCR01 **************************************************************
DCR01 *****IF EEC-MBR-SW = "N"
DCR01          GO TO 62-EDIT-TAX-CODE
DCR01 *****END-IF.

           IF EEC-COMMCODE-SW = "Y"
               IF SAVE-EEC-COMMCODE = SPACES
                   IF ARIBAITM-EEC-COMM-CODE = SPACES
      *                "COMMODITY CODE MUST BE ENTERED"
                       MOVE WS-COMMCD-MSG1  TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
                       MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
                       GO TO 62-PID-X
                   ELSE
                       MOVE ARIBAITM-EEC-COMM-CODE TO COMMCODE-ARG
                     PERFORM 9060-READK-EEC-COMMCD THRU 9060-READK-EXIT
                     IF FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
      *************  "INVALID COMMODITY CODE"
                        MOVE WS-COMMCD-MSG2    TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
                        MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
                        GO TO 62-PID-X
                     ELSE
                         NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
               IF ARIBAITM-EEC-COMM-CODE > SPACES
                   MOVE ARIBAITM-EEC-COMM-CODE TO COMMCODE-ARG
                   PERFORM 9060-READK-EEC-COMMCD THRU 9060-READK-EXIT
                   IF FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
      *                "INVALID COMMODITY CODE"
                       MOVE WS-COMMCD-MSG2    TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
                       MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
                       GO TO 62-PID-X
                   ELSE
                   IF SAVE-EEC-COMMCODE = ARIBAITM-EEC-COMM-CODE
                       NEXT SENTENCE
                   ELSE
      *            "COMMODITY CODE CANNOT BE CHANGED - ORIGINAL REDISPLAYED"
                   MOVE WS-COMMCD-MSG3    TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
                   MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
                   GO TO 62-PID-X
               ELSE
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF SAVE-EEC-COMMCODE = SPACES
               IF ARIBAITM-EEC-COMM-CODE = SPACES
                    NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
               MOVE ARIBAITM-EEC-COMM-CODE TO COMMCODE-ARG
               PERFORM 9060-READK-EEC-COMMCD THRU 9060-READK-EXIT
               IF FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
      *        "INVALID COMMODITY CODE"
                  MOVE WS-COMMCD-MSG2    TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
                  MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
                  GO TO 62-PID-X
               ELSE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           IF ARIBAITM-EEC-COMM-CODE > SPACES
               MOVE ARIBAITM-EEC-COMM-CODE TO COMMCODE-ARG
               PERFORM 9060-READK-EEC-COMMCD THRU 9060-READK-EXIT
               IF FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
      *        "INVALID COMMODITY CODE"
                   MOVE WS-COMMCD-MSG2    TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
                   MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
                   GO TO 62-PID-X
               ELSE
               IF SAVE-EEC-COMMCODE = ARIBAITM-EEC-COMM-CODE
                   NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
      *        "COMMODITY CODE CANNOT BE CHANGED"
                   MOVE WS-COMMCD-MSG3    TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
                   MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
                   GO TO 62-PID-X.

       62-EDIT-EEC-COO.

           IF ARIBAITM-EEC-CNTRY-ORIGIN = SPACES
               GO TO 62-EDIT-TAX-CODE
           END-IF.

           MOVE "EECCC " TO CVALID-CODE-TYPE.
           MOVE ARIBAITM-EEC-CNTRY-ORIGIN TO CVALID-CODE-KEY.
           PERFORM 9070-READK-VALID-DATA THRU 9070-READK-EXIT
           IF FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
               MOVE BU-DISPLAY-MSG TO MSG-TXT
               MOVE CVALID-CODE-KEY TO MSG-FLD
               MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
               GO TO 62-PID-X
           ELSE
               IF FS-GOOD-FILE-IO
                   GO TO 62-EDIT-TAX-CODE
               ELSE
                   MOVE WS-EECCOO-MSG1       TO MSG-TXT
                   MOVE CVALID-CODE-KEY TO MSG-FLD
                   MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
                   GO TO 62-PID-X
               END-IF
           END-IF.
DCR01 *****END OF EEC PROCESS **************************************

       62-EDIT-TAX-CODE.

           MOVE ARIBAITM-TAX-CODE TO TAX-ARG.
           PERFORM 9050-READK-MTAX     THRU 9050-READK-EXIT
           IF FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
      *      "TAX CODE DOES NOT EXIST"
              MOVE WS-TAXCD-MSG1        TO MSG-TXT
              MOVE ARIBAITM-TAX-CODE    TO MSG-FLD
              MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
              GO TO 62-PID-X
           END-IF.

       62-EDIT-COMMENT-NO.

           PERFORM 621-EDIT-COMMENTS  THRU  621-EC-X
               VARYING SUB1  FROM 1 BY 1
                   UNTIL SUB1 > 4  OR  ITEM-VALID-SW = "N".
           IF ITEM-VALID-SW = "N"
               GO TO 62-PID-X.

       62-EDIT-RCV-COMMENT-NO.

           PERFORM 621-EDIT-RCV-COMMENTS  THRU  621-ERC-X
               VARYING SUB1  FROM 1 BY 1
                   UNTIL SUB1 > 4  OR  ITEM-VALID-SW = "N".

       62-PID-X.
           EXIT.

       620-PCPO-EDITS.
           IF SAVE-PCPO-SW = "N"
               GO TO 620-PE-X
           END-IF.

           IF ARIBAITM-COMPANY = SPACES
      *    "COMPANY IS A REQUIRED FIELD"
               MOVE WS-COMPANY-MSG1      TO MSG-TXT
               MOVE ARIBAITM-COMPANY     TO MSG-FLD
               MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
               GO TO 620-PE-X
           ELSE
           MOVE "CO" TO MVALIDPLT-ARG-1-2
           MOVE ARIBAITM-COMPANY TO MVALIDPLT-ARG-3-10
           PERFORM 9010-READK-MVALPLTDTA    THRU 9010-READK-EXIT
           IF FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
      *        "COMPANY IS INVALID"
               MOVE WS-COMPANY-MSG2      TO MSG-TXT
               MOVE MVALIDPLT-ARG        TO MSG-FLD
               MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
               GO TO 620-PE-X.

           IF ARIBAITM-PRIME = SPACES
      *        "PRIME IS A REQUIRED FIELD"
               MOVE WS-PRIME-MSG1      TO MSG-TXT
               MOVE MVALIDPLT-ARG      TO MSG-FLD
               MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
               GO TO 620-PE-X
           ELSE
           MOVE "PR" TO MVALIDPLT-ARG-1-2
           MOVE ARIBAITM-PRIME TO MVALIDPLT-ARG-3-10
           PERFORM 9010-READK-MVALPLTDTA    THRU 9010-READK-EXIT
           IF FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
      *    "PRIME IS INVALID"
              MOVE WS-PRIME-MSG2      TO MSG-TXT
              MOVE MVALIDPLT-ARG      TO MSG-FLD
              MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
              GO TO 620-PE-X.

           IF ARIBAITM-CLASS = SPACES
      *    "CLASS IS A REQUIRED FIELD"
               MOVE WS-CLASS-MSG1      TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
               MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
               GO TO 620-PE-X
           ELSE
           IF ARIBAITM-SUB = "CNS"
               IF ARIBAITM-CORP-CODE NOT = "NON-STR"
                   GO TO 620-PE-X
               ELSE
               IF ARIBAITM-EXP-NW = "000000" OR SPACES
                   GO TO 620-PE-X
               ELSE
               MOVE "NW" TO MVALIDPLT-ARG-1-2
               MOVE ARIBAITM-EXP-NW TO MVALIDPLT-ARG-3-10
               PERFORM 9010-READK-MVALPLTDTA    THRU 9010-READK-EXIT
               IF FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
      *            "EXP/NW IS INVALID FOR CLASS"
                   MOVE WS-EXPNW-MSG1     TO MSG-TXT
                   MOVE MVALIDPLT-ARG     TO MSG-FLD
                   MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
                   GO TO 620-PE-X
               ELSE
               GO TO 620-PE-X
           ELSE
           IF ARIBAITM-CORP-CODE = "NON-STR"
               MOVE SPACES  TO MVALIDPLT-ARG
               MOVE "EC"    TO MVALIDPLT-ARG-1-2
               MOVE ARIBAITM-SUB-REDF TO MVALIDPLT-ARG-3-8
               PERFORM 9010-READK-MVALPLTDTA    THRU 9010-READK-EXIT
               IF FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
      *            "CLASS ENTERED IS INVALID"
                   MOVE WS-CLASS-MSG2     TO MSG-TXT
                   MOVE MVALIDPLT-ARG     TO MSG-FLD
                   MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
                   GO TO 620-PE-X
               ELSE
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
           GO TO 620-PE-X.

           IF ARIBAITM-SUB = "000"
               MOVE "NW" TO MVALIDPLT-ARG-1-2
               MOVE ARIBAITM-EXP-NW TO MVALIDPLT-ARG-3-10
               PERFORM 9010-READK-MVALPLTDTA    THRU 9010-READK-EXIT
               IF FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
      *            "EXP/NW ENTERED IS INVALID FOR CLASS"
                   MOVE WS-EXPNW-MSG1     TO MSG-TXT
                   MOVE MVALIDPLT-ARG     TO MSG-FLD
                   MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
                   GO TO 620-PE-X
               ELSE
               GO TO 620-PE-X.

           IF ARIBAITM-SUB NOT < "001"
               IF ARIBAITM-SUB NOT > "999"
                   IF ARIBAITM-CORP-CODE NOT = "NC"
                       GO TO 620-PE-X
                   ELSE
                   IF ARIBAITM-EXP-NW = SPACES OR "000000"
                       NEXT SENTENCE
                   ELSE
                   MOVE "NW" TO MVALIDPLT-ARG-1-2
                   MOVE ARIBAITM-EXP-NW TO MVALIDPLT-ARG-3-10
               PERFORM 9010-READK-MVALPLTDTA    THRU 9010-READK-EXIT
                   IF FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
      *               "EXP/NW IS INVALID FOR CLASS"
                       MOVE WS-EXPNW-MSG1     TO MSG-TXT
                       MOVE MVALIDPLT-ARG     TO MSG-FLD
                       MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
                       GO TO 620-PE-X
                   ELSE
                   GO TO 620-PE-X.

           MOVE "NW" TO MVALIDPLT-ARG-1-2.
           MOVE ARIBAITM-EXP-NW TO MVALIDPLT-ARG-3-10.
           PERFORM 9010-READK-MVALPLTDTA    THRU 9010-READK-EXIT.
           IF FS-GOOD-FILE-IO
               IF ARIBAITM-SUB NOT < "000" AND
                  ARIBAITM-SUB NOT > "099"
                   NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
      *        "CLASS ENTERED IS INVALID"
               MOVE WS-CLASS-MSG2     TO MSG-TXT
               MOVE MVALIDPLT-ARG     TO MSG-FLD
               MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
               GO TO 620-PE-X
           ELSE
           IF ARIBAITM-SUB NOT < "000" AND
              ARIBAITM-SUB NOT > "099"
      *        "EXP/NW IS INVALID FOR CLASS"
               MOVE WS-EXPNW-MSG1     TO MSG-TXT
               MOVE MVALIDPLT-ARG     TO MSG-FLD
               MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW.

       620-PE-X.
           EXIT.

      *********************************
      *
      *   EDIT STD. INSTRUCTIONS
      *
      *********************************

       621-EDIT-COMMENTS.

           IF ARIBAITM-STD-INST (SUB1) = SPACES
               GO TO 621-EC-X
           END-IF.

           MOVE ARIBAITM-STD-INST (SUB1) TO BUILD-COM-NO.
           MOVE "C" TO BUILD-COM-PREFIX.
           MOVE BUILD-COMMENT-NO TO COMMENT-ARG.
           PERFORM 9040-READK-MCOMMENT      THRU 9040-READK-EXIT.
           IF FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
      *      "INSTRUCTION NUMBER DOES NOT EXIST"
              MOVE WS-COMMENT-MSG1   TO MSG-TXT
              MOVE ARIBAITM-STD-INST(SUB1) TO MSG-FLD
              MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
           END-IF.

       621-EC-X.
           EXIT.

      *********************************
      *
      *   EDIT RCV. INSTRUCTIONS
      *
      *********************************

       621-EDIT-RCV-COMMENTS.

           IF ARIBAITM-RCV-INST (SUB1) = SPACES
               GO TO 621-ERC-X
           END-IF.

           MOVE ARIBAITM-RCV-INST (SUB1) TO BUILD-COM-NO.
           MOVE "R" TO BUILD-COM-PREFIX.
           MOVE BUILD-COMMENT-NO TO COMMENT-ARG.
           PERFORM 9040-READK-MCOMMENT      THRU 9040-READK-EXIT.
           IF FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
      *      "INSTRUCTION NUMBER DOES NOT EXIST"
              MOVE WS-COMMENT-MSG1    TO MSG-TXT
              MOVE ARIBAITM-RCV-INST(SUB1)  TO MSG-FLD
              MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
           END-IF.

       621-ERC-X.
           EXIT.

      *********************************
      *
      *   CODED PO EDITS PROCEDURE
      *
      *********************************

       621-EDIT-CODED-ITEM.

           MOVE ARIBAITM-CORP-CODE    TO  CODE-ARG.
           PERFORM 9020-READK-MSTOREROOM    THRU 9020-READK-EXIT.
DCR04 *---------------------------------------------------------------
DCR04 *  IF ITEM FOUND IN STOREROOM AND ITS A CODED ITEM FOR THE
DCR04 *  NAPANEE STOREROOM
DCR04 *     THEN MOVE ZEROS TO THE EXPENSE CLASS FIELD
DCR04 *          UPDATE THE ITEM ARRAY PASSED FROM CALLER
DCR04 *---------------------------------------------------------------
DCR04      IF FS-GOOD-FILE-IO
DCR04         IF ARIBAITM-COMPANY = "631"
DCR04            IF  ARIBAITM-SUB-DETL = SAVE-STR-DEPT
DCR04                MOVE WS-ZERO-EXP-CLS   TO ARIBAITM-EXP-NW
DCR04                MOVE BUF-ARIBAPO-DETAIL TO ARIBAITEM-AREA(SUB)
DCR04            END-IF
DCR04         END-IF
DCR04      END-IF.


DCR03 *---------------------------------------------------------------
DCR03 *  IF ITEM NOT FOUND IN STOREROOM AND ITS SUPPOSEDLY A CODED
DCR03 *  ITEM FOR THE STOREROOM AND EXPENSE CLASS = ZERO OR SPACE
DCR03 *       THEN  GENERATE AN ERROR MESSAGE (NOT A CODED ITEM)
DCR03 *---------------------------------------------------------------
           IF FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
DCR03           MOVE ARIBAITM-EXP-NW  TO WS-FUNKY-EXP-CLS-SW
                IF  ARIBAITM-SUB-DETL = SAVE-STR-DEPT
DCR03           AND ZERO-OR-BLANK-EXP-CLS
      *---------------------------------------------------------
      *  "MUST BE CODED ITEM FOR STOREROOM DEPT"
      *---------------------------------------------------------
                    MOVE WS-STORERM-MSG1     TO MSG-TXT
                    MOVE ARIBAITM-SUB-DETL   TO MSG-FLD
                    MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
                    GO TO 621-ECI-X
                ELSE
      *---------------------------------------------------------
      *  "IF NOT STOREROOM, CHANGE CORP CODE = "NON-STR"
      *---------------------------------------------------------
                    MOVE "NON-STR"        TO ARIBAITM-CORP-CODE
                    MOVE BUF-ARIBAPO-DETAIL TO ARIBAITEM-AREA(SUB)
                    GO TO 621-ECI-X
                END-IF
           END-IF.


           IF ARIBAITM-UNIT-MEASURE = STR-UM OR
                                      STR-UM1 OR
                                      STR-UM2
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
      *      "QUANTITY UM IS NOT A STOREROOM UM"
              MOVE WS-UOM-MSG4        TO MSG-TXT
              MOVE ARIBAITM-UNIT-MEASURE  TO MSG-FLD
              MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
              GO TO 621-ECI-X
            END-IF.

           IF ARIBAITM-PRICE-UM = STR-UM OR
                                  STR-UM1 OR
                                  STR-UM2
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
      *       "PRICE UM IS NOT A STOREROOM UM"
               MOVE WS-UOM-MSG5        TO MSG-TXT
               MOVE ARIBAITM-PRICE-UM  TO MSG-FLD
               MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
               GO TO 621-ECI-X
            END-IF.

      *****IF EEC-COMMCODE-SW = "Y"
      *****    MOVE STR-PREV-CODE       TO  SAVE-EEC-COMMCODE
      *****END-IF.

       621-ECI-X.
           EXIT.

      *********************************
      *
      *  NON-CODED PO EDITS PROCEDURE
      *
      *********************************

       621-EDIT-NONCODED-ITEM.
           IF ARIBAITM-UNIT-MEASURE = ARIBAITM-PRICE-UM
               NEXT SENTENCE
           ELSE
      *      "QUANTITY AND PRICE UM MUST EQUAL FOR A NON-CODED PO
               MOVE WS-UOM-MSG6        TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
               MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
               GO TO 621-ENI-X
           END-IF.

      ********************************************
      *
      *  IF THIS ORDER IS A NON-RECEIVABLE MAKE SURE THE
      *  ITEMS ARE NON-CODED.  THEY CANNOT CREATE
      *  CODED NON-RECEIVABLE POs USING THIS
      *  PROGRAM
      *
      ********************************************

           IF NON-RECV-SW = "Y"
               IF ARIBAITM-CORP-CODE = "NON-STR"
                   NEXT SENTENCE
               ELSE
      **        "NON-RECEIVABLE MUST BE NON-CODED ENTER 'NC' IN CODE"
                   MOVE WS-NR-MSG1         TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
                   MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
                   GO TO 621-ENI-X
               END-IF
           END-IF.


           IF  ARIBAITM-SUB-DETL = SAVE-STR-DEPT
      *---------------------------------------------------------
      *  "MUST BE CODED ITEM FOR STOREROOM DEPT"
      *---------------------------------------------------------
               MOVE WS-STORERM-MSG1     TO MSG-TXT
               MOVE ARIBAITM-SUB-DETL   TO MSG-FLD
               MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
               GO TO 621-ENI-X
           END-IF.

       621-ENI-X.
           EXIT.

DCR02 *****************************************************************
DCR02 ***
DCR02 ***  LINE ITEM EDITS SPECIFIC TO CHANGE CANCEL PROCESSING
DCR02 ***
DCR02 *****************************************************************
DCR02  625-CHG-CNL-EDITS.

DCR02 **==CHG\CNL======================================================
DCR02 **  MUST HAVE CSIS PO NUMBER
DCR02 **===============================================================
DCR02      IF  ARIBAITM-CSISPO-NUMBER OF BUF-ARIBAPO-DETAIL = SPACE
DCR02          MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
DCR02          MOVE WS-CC-PO-NBR-MISSING-MSG TO MSG-TXT
DCR02          MOVE ARIBAITM-ITEM-NUMBER  TO WS-ITEM-ERR-NBR
DCR02          MOVE WS-ITEM-ERR-MSG       TO MSG-FLD
DCR02          GO TO 625-CC-EXIT
DCR02      END-IF.

DCR02      MOVE "P"                    TO  PO-PREFIX.
DCR02      MOVE ARIBAITM-CSISPO-NUMBER TO  PO-NO.
DCR02      MOVE ZERO                   TO  PO-REL.
DCR02      MOVE ZERO                   TO  PO-RCV.
DCR02      MOVE BUILD-PO-SEARCH        TO  PO2-ARG.

DCR02 **==CHG\CNL======================================================
DCR02 **  DPOITEM RECORD MUST EXIST
DCR02 **===============================================================
DCR02      PERFORM 9080-READK-DPOITEM  THRU 9080-READK-EXIT.
DCR02      IF FS-RECORD-NOT-FOUND
DCR02 *      "LINE ITEM RECORD DOES NOT EXIST"
DCR02         MOVE WS-CC-LINE-ITEM-NFND-MSG TO MSG-TXT
DCR02         MOVE ARIBAITM-ITEM-NUMBER  TO WS-ITEM-ERR-NBR
DCR02         MOVE WS-ITEM-ERR-MSG       TO MSG-FLD
DCR02         MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
DCR02         GO TO 625-CC-EXIT
DCR02      END-IF.

DCR02 **==CHG\CNL======================================================
DCR02 *=  ORDER QTY CAN NOT BE LESS THAN WHATS ALREADY BEEN RECEIVED
DCR02 **===============================================================
DCR02      IF  ARIBAITM-QTY-ORDERED < ITM-QTY-DLVR
DCR02          MOVE WS-CC-ITM-QTY-ERR-MSG1 TO MSG-TXT
DCR02          MOVE ARIBAITM-ITEM-NUMBER   TO WS-ITEM-ERR-NBR
DCR02          MOVE WS-ITEM-ERR-MSG        TO MSG-FLD
DCR02          MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
DCR02          GO TO 625-CC-EXIT
DCR02      END-IF.

DCR02 **==CHG\CNL======================================================
DCR02 *=  UNIT PRICE CAN NOT BE CHANGED AFTER RECEIPT
DCR02 **===============================================================
DCR02 **** IF  ARIBAITM-UNIT-PRICE NOT = ITM-UNIT-PRICE
DCR02 ****     IF  ITM-QTY-DLVR > ZERO
DCR02 ****         MOVE WS-CC-ITM-PRC-ERR-MSG1 TO MSG-TXT
DCR02 ****         MOVE ARIBAITM-ITEM-NUMBER   TO WS-ITEM-ERR-NBR
DCR02 ****         MOVE WS-ITEM-ERR-MSG        TO MSG-FLD
DCR02 ****         MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
DCR02 ****         GO TO 625-CC-EXIT
DCR02 ****     END-IF
DCR02 **** END-IF.

DCR02 **==CHG\CNL======================================================
DCR02 *=  UOM CAN'T BE CHANGED AFTER RECEIPT
DCR02 **===============================================================
DCR02      IF  ARIBAITM-UNIT-MEASURE NOT = ITM-UM
DCR02          IF  ITM-QTY-DLVR > ZERO
DCR02              MOVE WS-CC-ITM-UOM-ERR-MSG1 TO MSG-TXT
DCR02              MOVE ARIBAITM-ITEM-NUMBER   TO WS-ITEM-ERR-NBR
DCR02              MOVE WS-ITEM-ERR-MSG        TO MSG-FLD
DCR02              MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
DCR02              GO TO 625-CC-EXIT
DCR02          END-IF
DCR02      END-IF.

DCR02 **==CHG\CNL======================================================
DCR02 *=  PRICE UOM CAN'T BE CHANGED AFTER RECEIPT
DCR02 **===============================================================
DCR02      IF  ARIBAITM-PRICE-UM  NOT = ITM-PRICE-UM
DCR02          IF  ITM-QTY-DLVR > ZERO
DCR02              MOVE WS-CC-ITM-UOM-ERR-MSG2 TO MSG-TXT
DCR02              MOVE ARIBAITM-ITEM-NUMBER   TO WS-ITEM-ERR-NBR
DCR02              MOVE WS-ITEM-ERR-MSG        TO MSG-FLD
DCR02              MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
DCR02              GO TO 625-CC-EXIT
DCR02          END-IF
DCR02      END-IF.
DCR02 ****************************************************************

DCR02 **==CHG\CNL======================================================
DCR02 *=  DEPT CAN'T BE CHANGED AFTER RECEIPT
DCR02 **===============================================================
DCR02      IF  ARIBAITM-SUB-DETL  NOT = ITM-SUB-DETL
DCR02          IF  ITM-QTY-DLVR > ZERO
DCR02              MOVE WS-CC-ITM-DPT-ERR-MSG1 TO MSG-TXT
DCR02              MOVE ARIBAITM-ITEM-NUMBER   TO WS-ITEM-ERR-NBR
DCR02              MOVE WS-ITEM-ERR-MSG        TO MSG-FLD
DCR02              MOVE "N" TO ITEM-VALID-SW
DCR02              GO TO 625-CC-EXIT
DCR02          END-IF
DCR02      END-IF.

DCR02  625-CC-EXIT.
DCR02      EXIT.

       COPY ZMPLTSUBR   IN COPYLIB.

      *****************************************************************
      ***  READ BY KEY MVALPLTDTA
      *****************************************************************
       9010-READK-MVALPLTDTA.

           INITIALIZE MVALPLTDTA-REC.
           MOVE  MVALIDPLT-ARG    TO VALDTAKEY OF MVALPLTDTA-REC.

           READ MVALPLTDTA-FILE
           END-READ.


       9010-READK-EXIT.
            EXIT.
      *****************************************************************
