      *****************************************************************
       9020-READK-MSTOREROOM.

           INITIALIZE MSTOREROOM-REC.
           MOVE  CODE-ARG         TO CORPCDE  OF MSTOREROOM-REC.

           READ MSTOREROOM-FILE
           END-READ.

       9020-READK-EXIT.
            EXIT.
      *****************************************************************
