      *****************************************************************
       9030-READK-MVALIDUM.

           INITIALIZE MVALIDUM-REC.
           MOVE  UM-ARG           TO VALIDUM  OF MVALIDUM-REC.

           READ MVALIDUM-FILE
           END-READ.


       9030-READK-EXIT.
            EXIT.
      *****************************************************************
      ***  READ BY KEY MCOMMENT
      *****************************************************************
       9040-READK-MCOMMENT.

           INITIALIZE MCOMMENT-REC.
           MOVE  COMMENT-ARG      TO MCOMCOMMNT  OF MCOMMENT-REC.

           READ MCOMMENT-FILE
           END-READ.

       9040-READK-EXIT.
            EXIT.
      *****************************************************************
      ***  READ BY KEY MTAX
      *****************************************************************
       9050-READK-MTAX.

           INITIALIZE MTAX-REC.
           MOVE  TAX-ARG          TO TAXCDE   OF MTAX-REC.

           READ MTAX-FILE
           END-READ.

       9050-READK-EXIT.
