      *****************************************************************
      ***  READ BY KEY EEC COMMODITY CODE FILE
      *****************************************************************
       9060-READK-EEC-COMMCD.

           INITIALIZE EEC-COMMCD-REC.
           MOVE  COMMCODE-ARG     TO EECCOMCODE OF EEC-COMMCD-REC.

           READ EEC-COMMCD-FILE
           END-READ.

       9060-READK-EXIT.
            EXIT.
      *****************************************************************
      ***  READ BY KEY VALID DATA FILE
      *****************************************************************
       9070-READK-VALID-DATA.

           INITIALIZE VALID-DATA-REC.
           MOVE  COMMCODE-ARG     TO VLDCODEKEY     OF VALID-DATA-REC.

           READ VALID-DATA-FILE
           END-READ.

       9070-READK-EXIT.
            EXIT.
DCR02 *****************************************************************
DCR02 ***  READ BY KEY DPOITEM FILE
DCR02 *****************************************************************
DCR02  9080-READK-DPOITEM.
DCR02
DCR02      INITIALIZE DPOITEM-REC.
DCR02      MOVE PO2-ARG          TO ITM-PO-RCV-NO.
DCR02      MOVE ARIBAITM-ITEM-NUMBER  TO ITM-NUMBER.
DCR02
DCR02      READ DPOITEM-FILE
DCR02      END-READ.
DCR02
DCR02  9080-READK-EXIT.
DCR02       EXIT.
      *****************************************************************
      ***                 END  OF  SOURCE  MEMBER
      *****************************************************************
